WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.283
Last touch attribution gives the final click all the credit for a sale.

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:05.297
So budgets drift to the bottom of the funnel,

00:00:05.347 --> 00:00:07.667
the brand starves,

00:00:07.717 --> 00:00:10.618
and privacy rules are breaking the tracking anyway.

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:15.307
It's like a group assignment where whoever hits submit gets the whole mark.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.556
Nike moved spend to the bottom of the funnel.

00:00:18.606 --> 00:00:22.494
People stopped seeing its ads, and the brand faded from memory.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.424
Use it like this:

00:00:24.474 --> 00:00:26.711
credit the ads people saw but never clicked,

00:00:26.761 --> 00:00:29.110
and measure the whole market.
